<title>USA: Newmont seen starting anew for merger target.</title>
<headline>Newmont seen starting anew for merger target.</headline>
<byline>Brendan Intindola</byline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Newmont Mining Corp is likely to end its pursuit of Santa Fe Pacific Gold Corp and turn its sights to other targets now that Santa Fe has found a friendly buyer in Homestake Mining Co.</p>
<p>While Newmont is expected to resume the hunt, analysts say with Santa Fe's agreement to be bought for $2.3 billion by Homestake, it has lost out on the best of the mid-sized gold producers. Its possible targets now include Cambior Inc, AMAX Gold Inc and Echo Bay Mines Ltd, analysts said.</p>
</text>
